{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Pyramid Game","Seong Su-ji, a student who frequently transfers schools, arrives at Love High School's Class 2-5 around August. As always, she greets others kindly and tries to make friends like any normal student. But she is unexpectedly chosen as the target of mysterious Pyramid Game—something she'd never even heard of—and soon becomes a victim of ruthless bullying. She struggles to escape from being an outcast.\n\n(Source: Laftel)"],"ja":["피라미드 게임",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-61847","ids":{"shikimori":61847,"mal":61847,"anilist":168631,"kodik":"serial-68644"},"kodikIds":["serial-68163","serial-68644"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-68163":"2025-07-27T07:21:32Z","serial-68644":"2025-08-09T07:17:01Z"},"title":"Игра в пирамиду","originalTitle":"Pyramid Game","alt":"피라미드 게임 Pyramid Game 피라미드 게임","description":"В элитной женской школе действует жестокая система рейтингов — «Пирамида». Каждый месяц ученицы голосуют, распределяя друг друга по уровням от А до F. Те, кто оказываются на самом дне, становятся жертвами травли и издевательств. Новенькая Суджи Сон случайно получает ранг F и сталкивается с безжалостной стороной школьного общества. Но вместо того чтобы сдаться, она решает изменить правила игры.","year":2025,"type":"ONA","genres":["Драма","психологическое","Школа"],"rating":6.12,"popularity":1652,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/61847/ef87a9d7392ca867542c04833286d3a4.jpeg","width":700,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/ba4187c70db97d0752a20c9f6e3ce46f2c6d492d.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-3293","dubId":"3293","label":"VF-Studio","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef